<title>FRANCE: EU's de Silguy - private, official ecu to converge.</title>
<headline>EU's de Silguy - private, official ecu to converge.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interest rates on the private ecu should converge with those on the offical ecu before the launch of European monetary union in 1999, European Commissioner Yves-Thibault de Silguy said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;At the present moment, we are seeing rates on the private ecu coming closer to rates on the official ecu,&quot; he said in an interview on French television.</p>
<p>&quot;Before the move to the euro, you will have a merging of rates on the private ecu and the official ecu because expectations are going in that direction,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
